    "content": "Chuck Norris has five children: Mike (born 1962), Eric (born 1965), and Dina (born 1964), as well as twins Dakota and Danilee (born 2001). Mike and Eric are from his first marriage to Dianne Holechek, while the twins are with his wife Gena O'Kelley. Dina was born from a previous relationship. Mike Norris (born 1962): An actor and stunt performer who has worked on Walker, Texas Ranger. Dina Norris (born 1964): Norris discovered he had this daughter from an extramarital affair in 2004, whom he met at age 26. Eric Norris (born 1965): A NASCAR champion and Hollywood stuntman. Dakota Alan Norris (born 2001): Twin son with Gena O'Kelley. Danilee Kelly Norris (born 2001): Twin daughter with Gena O'Kelley. Norris has 13 grandchildren as of March 2026.",
